    "message": "[ipa-delivery:672] build(delivery): request the private IPA672 delivery\n\nFrozen at 4702f382 (effective digest 9af3c4d7, 7252 product files):\nRPCS3 Core 902 (pin 0e75e5fb, run 42215603048) replaces Core 668:\nthe native Metal 4 renderer (stages M1 and M2), opt-in per title from\nthe in-game accuracy tests page; Automatic keeps Vulkan on MoltenVK.\nMeloNX Core 671 (pin 7799d979, run 42217058211 attempt 2) replaces Core\n667: Hogwarts fast math again plus the Hogwarts-only NaN scrub; Hogwarts\nrebuilds its shader translations once on its first launch. The early JIT\nescrow logs a VA census (AC IV JIT arena exhaustion). Base: the delivered\n669 (run 42144057315). Dry-run freeze passed. Recipient key 672 (public\nhalf only).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_012mUAShv9k6pSCnpW7oAF63",
